              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Anini tatabe diqo tana qarqaarsa Silwano, ka anini aka oboleesa d'uga heregad'utiini, t'aafe. Anini isani jabeesu fed'a, ammalle aka eebiti Waaqaaqaaqa d'uga, isaniti himu fed'a. Eeba tanaani jabaad'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.12"
            ]
          }
